[15:13.08]adverse [ˈædvɜːs]a. 反向的，逆的；有害的；敌对的，对 抗(性)的 搭 be adverse to 与…相反，对…不利 / in adverse conditions 处于逆境
[15:23.16]consignment [kənˈsaɪnmənt]n. 委托(物)；寄存(物)；委托代销 (物) 例 We are faced with the problem that part of the consignment is unacceptable. 搭 on consignment 以委托方式；以代销方式
[15:39.36]booklet [ˈbʊklət]n. 小册子；资料簿 例 They have designed a health education booklet for community residents.
